    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to WHAT THE PAK?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many mini-games are at your disposal, my lord\u2026 lady\u2026 captain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for a 3D party game with fast-paced gameplay, your search ends here. WHAT THE PAK?! is a minigame-rush party game that rewards fast play and parkour skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our little wannabe monsters don\u2019t know the word \u201clogic.\u201d When they see a cliff, they jump. When they see a crown, they steal it. When they see a bomb, they explode. If you want a carefree gaming experience like our little PAKs, join our ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S.: Bombs are highly dangerous, explosive devices. DO NOT LET THEM EXPLODE IN YOUR HANDS!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/dd5753efeee51f19ea69b56f4159c52c.poster.avif?t=1752156823\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/dd5753efeee51f19ea69b56f4159c52c.webm?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/dd5753efeee51f19ea69b56f4159c52c.mp4?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We have plenty of mini-games to enjoy while you annoy your lifelong friends or a few strangers who might become lifelong friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/e6b3bff45b267a3adeea3bb3acbc4525.poster.avif?t=1752156823\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/e6b3bff45b267a3adeea3bb3acbc4525.webm?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/e6b3bff45b267a3adeea3bb3acbc4525.mp4?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Before declaring your kingdom upon the Ancient Ruins, make sure you explode your rivals in the beautiful sunset of the Japanese Forest. Or maybe you prefer something chillier. How about an epic battle on the icy ground of the Arctic? It\u2019s your call!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/545d7a0e81912912e052c002e4defc38.poster.avif?t=1752156823\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/545d7a0e81912912e052c002e4defc38.webm?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/545d7a0e81912912e052c002e4defc38.mp4?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>All the best memories are made with lifelong friends or potential lifelong friends. Gather your mates and get ready to test the limits of your friendship\u2026 What were you expecting? It\u2019s a party game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/633960c20a518ca9f299aa6b50e4a7d6.poster.avif?t=1752156823\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/633960c20a518ca9f299aa6b50e4a7d6.webm?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/633960c20a518ca9f299aa6b50e4a7d6.mp4?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Express your PAK's personality with our freshly made costumes. Are you an artist, a rebel, or a gentleman? Maybe you're here to hit the dance floor. We don't know, but we do care. You can choose anything from our distinctly organized wardrobe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEED THE CALL! CHAOS IS CALLING FOR YOU! IT ORDERED PEPPERONI PIZZA FOR THE PARTY!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to WHAT THE PAK?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many mini-games are at your disposal, my lord\u2026 lady\u2026 captain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re looking for a 3D party game with fast-paced gameplay, your search ends here. WHAT THE PAK?! is a minigame-rush party game that rewards fast play and parkour skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our little wannabe monsters don\u2019t know the word \u201clogic.\u201d When they see a cliff, they jump. When they see a crown, they steal it. When they see a bomb, they explode. If you want a carefree gaming experience like our little PAKs, join our ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>P.S.: Bombs are highly dangerous, explosive devices. DO NOT LET THEM EXPLODE IN YOUR HANDS!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/dd5753efeee51f19ea69b56f4159c52c.poster.avif?t=1752156823\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/dd5753efeee51f19ea69b56f4159c52c.webm?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2752710/extras/dd5753efeee51f19ea69b56f4159c52c.mp4?t=1752156823\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We have plenty of mini-games to enjoy while you annoy your lifelong friends or a few strangers who might become lifelong friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.ak